    "detailed_description": "<h1>FOLLOW FRENEMIES</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/6d55c4d35d8b0c33fdc300a4558ba6a7.poster.avif?t=1753709031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/6d55c4d35d8b0c33fdc300a4558ba6a7.webm?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/6d55c4d35d8b0c33fdc300a4558ba6a7.mp4?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frenemies is a cute multiplayer game that strands up to 10 players on a deserted island in the ultimate test of survival and betrayal. Build a town, form alliances and battle to become the last player standing in a game of social deception inspired by the hit TV show Survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/4ae696dd375af545afae8a92a847eba7.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island and learn how to farm, craft, cook, fish &amp; more. Build a base and complete quests to help contribute to your new island home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/2704e9db7196291dc7c4096b85579908.poster.avif?t=1753709031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/2704e9db7196291dc7c4096b85579908.webm?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/2704e9db7196291dc7c4096b85579908.mp4?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/f3d39381190618528539140278201725.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle for Immunity across multiple different islands and game modes including Capture the Chicken, Prop Hunt, Snowball Mayhem, Infected, Gold Rush, Pirate Heist, Hot Potato, King of the Hill, Treasure Hunt, Hide n Seek and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/e5bbadef2d34908ca0089ea5d79a16ae.poster.avif?t=1753709031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/e5bbadef2d34908ca0089ea5d79a16ae.webm?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/e5bbadef2d34908ca0089ea5d79a16ae.mp4?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/a445e0728a96ebb4d4ce301596831a92.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote to eliminate your enemies and become the last player standing. Use in-game proximity chat to build alliances or betray your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outplay them all by activating powerful runes to influence the vote.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/27b684a9763cbc6a1b85f34a847979f8.poster.avif?t=1753709031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/27b684a9763cbc6a1b85f34a847979f8.webm?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/27b684a9763cbc6a1b85f34a847979f8.mp4?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/4699eb7337d854d47284c458e20d600f.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminated players become the villains in battle and can activate shadow runes from beyond the grave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/462fa7135119200abd06bb3951c3ab51.poster.avif?t=1753709031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/462fa7135119200abd06bb3951c3ab51.webm?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/c47bc781e6d3d903a133a1b9bb5b760f.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with multiple player skins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/512d97d09140711f987fd8b16ce3f737.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And cute pets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/fd4dd6c7a87b1b68ac1b423ba4a3875f.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frenemies is a cute multiplayer game that strands up to 10 players on a deserted island in the ultimate test of survival and betrayal. Build a town, form alliances and battle to become the last player standing in a game of social deception inspired by the hit TV show Survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/4ae696dd375af545afae8a92a847eba7.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island and learn how to farm, craft, cook, fish &amp; more. Build a base and complete quests to help contribute to your new island home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/2704e9db7196291dc7c4096b85579908.poster.avif?t=1753709031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/2704e9db7196291dc7c4096b85579908.webm?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/2704e9db7196291dc7c4096b85579908.mp4?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/f3d39381190618528539140278201725.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle for Immunity across multiple different islands and game modes including Capture the Chicken, Prop Hunt, Snowball Mayhem, Infected, Gold Rush, Pirate Heist, Hot Potato, King of the Hill, Treasure Hunt, Hide n Seek and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i