4699eb7337d854d47284c458e20d600f.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminated players become the villains in battle and can activate shadow runes from beyond the grave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/462fa7135119200abd06bb3951c3ab51.poster.avif?t=1753709031\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/462fa7135119200abd06bb3951c3ab51.webm?t=1753709031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/c47bc781e6d3d903a133a1b9bb5b760f.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with multiple player skins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/512d97d09140711f987fd8b16ce3f737.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And cute pets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387270/extras/fd4dd6c7a87b1b68ac1b423ba4a3875f.avif?t=1753709031\" /></span></p>",
